        "title": "Fixed expenses 💸",
        "body": "Pitch fees → enter them in the market card itself (in Agenda). Other annual expenses (van insurance, social security, accountant, etc.) go in Settings → ANNUAL EXPENSES. The app spreads them across working days automatically."
